chx:X_UploadSpreadsheet a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:UploadSpreadsheet ; rdfs:label "ezsheets.upload('my_spreadsheet.xlsx')"@en ; skos:definition "upload() sends the file in a multipart request to Drive under its base name with the extension, accepts only xlsx, ods, csv and tsv files, and raises FileNotFoundError for a missing file and ValueError for another extension; the title Google then gives the spreadsheet was not observed."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
