chx:X_DownloadFileName a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:DownloadFileName ; rdfs:label "ss.downloadAsExcel('a_different_filename.xlsx')"@en ; skos:definition "The default file name is the title with every character other than a letter, digit, underscore or dot replaced by an underscore, so Sweigart Books (DO NOT DELETE) is saved as Sweigart_Books_(DO_NOT_DELETE).xlsx and not as the Sweigart_Books.xlsx the chapter prints; the parentheses survive."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
