chx:X_ValuesAsText a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ValuesAsText ; rdfs:label "sheet['B2'] = 30; sheet['B2']"@en ; skos:definition "The chapter says every value comes back as a string, and reading after a refresh does; the newest releases keep the value as written in the local copy, so sheet['B2'] is the integer 30 until the sheet is refreshed, and a write carries valueInputOption USER_ENTERED, which makes Google read the text as if a person had typed it."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
