chx:X_UpdateAllRows a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:UpdateAllRows ; rdfs:label "sheet.updateRows(rows)"@en ; skos:definition "updateRows sends every row in one request and grows the list of rows the caller passed in to the number of rows of the sheet, each row to its width."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
