chx:X_SheetSize a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:SheetSize ; rdfs:label "sheet.columnCount = 4"@en ; skos:definition "rowCount and columnCount can be assigned; each assignment costs three requests (read the spreadsheet, read the values, one batchUpdate), and the local copy keeps cells outside the smaller grid until the sheet is refreshed."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
