chx:X_CreateSheet a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:CreateSheet ; rdfs:label "ss.Sheet('Spam')"@en ; skos:definition "createSheet() returns the new Sheet, but the Spreadsheet.Sheet() method that the chapter uses in its listings is a wrapper that returns None, so the new sheet has to be fetched from ss.sheets or ss[title]."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
