chx:X_BlankRowError a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:BlankRowError ; rdfs:label "int(row[2]) on an empty row"@en ; skos:definition "getRows() returns every row of the grid, including empty ones at the end, and the audit loop's int(row[2]) raises ValueError on the first of them."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15/research> .
